# Pilot Results — placeholder

This directory will contain `PILOT_*.json` outputs from the smoke-test
runs of the pipeline against the synthetic data. Files in this directory
are **not** part of the C5/C8 evidence base and are never cited as
Experiment 002 results.

Planned layout (defined when `src/evaluate.py` lands and is run against
`../synthetic/raw_data/`):

```
PILOT_R1_Raw_transfer.json
PILOT_R1_Env_transfer.json
PILOT_R2_Raw_transfer.json
PILOT_R2_Env_transfer.json
PILOT_R3_Order_transfer.json
PILOT_pipeline_sanity.json     # IDFT 1X tracker convergence, window counts, etc.
```
